store.token_faq.question1=What are Tokens?
store.token_faq.answer1=Tokens are coins that are only available and usable on Minecraft for PlayStation®4 consoles. Tokens will not transfer to other game systems.
store.token_faq.question2=Can I use my Minecoins that I have bought on another device on my PlayStation®4 console?
store.token_faq.answer2=No, only Tokens can be used in the Minecraft Store on PlayStation®4 consoles. You will not be able to use Minecoins in the Minecraft Store on PlayStation®4 consoles.
store.token_faq.question3=If I buy a piece of content with Tokens will I be able to use it on my other devices?
store.token_faq.answer3=Certain pieces of content are only available on PlayStation®4 consoles. If you buy one of these pieces of content you will only be able to use it on PlayStation®4 consoles. Check the info page of a pack to see if it is exclusive to PlayStation®4 consoles. Any other packs that you purchase with Tokens will be available on all your other platforms.
store.token_faq.question4=Can I convert my Tokens to Minecoins?
store.token_faq.answer4=No, if you purchase Tokens they will always be Tokens.
store.token_faq.question5=If I bought a piece of content on a different device can I use that content on my PlayStation®4 console?
store.token_faq.answer5=Yes! Content bought on any version of the Minecraft Store that's not an exclusive item can be used on any system.
