howtoplay.gameSettings.text.9=§eActivate Cheats§f: This setting allows players to use commands. When a world is created with this setting on, all trophies are disabled.
howtoplay.multiplayer.text.3.has_subscription=Minecraft has three main ways you can play online multiplayer. You can play on a Realm, a server, or your own World. When you are signed in with your account for PlayStation™Network and your Microsoft account, your friends on other systems can join your world! Realms and servers require a Microsoft account.
howtoplay.multiplayer.text.3.no_subscription=Minecraft has three main ways you can play online multiplayer. You can play on a Realm, a server, or your own World. When you have a subscription to PlayStation®Plus and are signed in with your Microsoft account, your friends on other systems can join your world! Realms and servers require a Microsoft account.
