trial.tabbed_upsell.addon.description=Want to make wolves act like bunnies? Turn all the trees into cotton candy? You can alter everything in the full Minecraft experience with add-ons! Plus get access to Multiplayer, Creative mode, trophies and more! Buy Minecraft now for full access!
