trial.tabbed_upsell.store.description=Get access to the Minecraft Store. Switch up your look with new skins, change your world, or explore incredible new maps from the best community creators! Get the full game today!
trial.tabbed_upsell.xbl.description=With the full Minecraft experience you get Creative mode, trophies, and more, plus with a Microsoft account you can meet others in the Minecraft community! Join your friends' worlds, make new friends on Servers, and sync your Store purchases to everywhere you play Minecraft.
